This directory contains input data files for SPARTA/OpenEdge.
You can add your own files to this directory, using the existing files
as templates to get the format correct.

Files that end in ".species" contain thermophysical properties of
chemical species and are read by the species command.

Files that end in ".species.vib" contain additional info about the
vibrational modes of polyatomic chemical species.  They are read by
the species command via its "vibfile" option.

Files that end in ".vss" or ".vhs" or ".hs" contain collision model
parameters for the variable soft sphere (VSS), variable hard sphere
(VHS), or hard-sphere (HS) models.  These are read by the collide
command.

Files that end in ".tce" list reactions for gas-phase chemistry using
the Total Collision Energy (TCE) model and are read by the react
command.

Files that end in ".surf" list reactions for surface chemistry
and are read by the surf_react command.

These are the doc pages for various commands which describe the format
of the corresponding files:

species = doc/species.html
species.vib = doc/species.html
vss/vhs/hs = doc/collide.html
tce = doc/react.html
surf = doc/surf_react.html
